{"cases":[{"attack":true,"case":"The target states the relation is refuted if 'an increase in checklist granularity leads to a decrease in the frequency of documented discrepancy-driven resolutions.' This refutation condition is backwards relative to the causal claim. The target posits that excessive detail causes a transition from active reasoning to blind compliance — i.e., granularity undermines active discrepancy resolution. But under that mechanism, an increase in granularity DECREASING discrepancy resolutions would CONFIRM the hypothesis, not refute it. The stated refuted-if condition is thus self-confirming rather than genuinely falsifying.","counterexample":[{"discrepancy_resolutions":10,"granularity":"low","outcome":"confirms relation — active reasoning preserved"},{"discrepancy_resolutions":2,"granularity":"high","outcome":"would confirm the causal claim (graninality suppresses active reasoning), yet target labels this same observation as the refutation trigger"}],"target":"8b203928ce8d2338a615c6602461e6926647fc8a0f9fe2bdbad21bbf529a7cad"},{"attack":true,"case":"The refuted-if condition is mis-specified for the dependence claim. The target asserts reliability DEPENDS on a devil's advocate role. To refute a dependence claim, one must show reliability is preserved in the ABSENCE of the role. Instead, the target's refuted-if compares a harmonious panel (no devil's advocate) against a conflicted panel (presence of conflict, not necessarily a devil's advocate), conflating interpersonal conflict with the assigned role. A harmonious panel could lack a devil's advocate yet still exhibit corrective loops via other mechanisms, and a conflicted panel could lack the formal role entirely. The counterexample tests the wrong independent variable.","counterexample":[{"corrective_loops":"high","panel":"harmonious, no devil's advocate","refutes dependence":true,"target_refutation_triggered":false},{"corrective_loops":"high","panel":"conflicted, no devil's advocate","refutes dependence":true,"target_refutation_triggered":true}],"target":"ca9a9570ad485879a8d996f561633278cdb0ec060e4ee32dda8dcd0ad943b254"},{"attack":false,"case":"","target":"eb2e55f8096902190038fbd796ac98716c8af2aa215d48bd718b9c0286003bdb"}]}